"use strict";(self.webpackChunkchatgpt_shortcut=self.webpackChunkchatgpt_shortcut||[]).push([["4906"],{851606(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"id":767,"title":"\u516D\u90E8\u63D0\u95EE\u6CD5\u4E86\u89E3\u6982\u5FF5","description":"The Six Step Questioning Technique is an educational and learning strategy designed to help individuals gain a deep understanding of a topic or issue. This method encourages the questioner to think from different angles by breaking down the question, in order to better understand the essence of the problem. The Six Step Questioning Technique includes the following six steps:\\n\\nAsk Basic Questions: Start with the most basic questions, such as \\"What is this?\\" or \\"What is this concept about?\\" This helps establish a basic understanding of the issue.\\n\\nDelve Deeper: After understanding the basic information, try to delve into the details of the problem. Questions can include: \\"Why does this phenomenon occur?\\" or \\"What is the principle of this concept?\\"\\n\\nConsider Practical Applications: Understanding the practical application of a concept can help the questioner link theoretical knowledge with real-life situations. For example: \\"How is this concept applied in real life?\\" or \\"How does this theory work in practice?\\"\\n\\nDiscuss Relevant Examples: Providing examples helps deepen understanding of the issue. The questioner can ask: \\"Can you give an example of this concept applied in real life?\\" or \\"What is a typical case about this topic?\\"\\n\\nCompare and Contrast: By comparing and contrasting similar concepts or problems, the questioner can better understand the uniqueness of the topic. For example: \\"How is this concept different from other related concepts?\\" or \\"What are the similarities and differences between this problem and similar ones?\\"\\n\\nSummarize and Reflect: After understanding all aspects of a problem, the questioner can attempt to summarize what they have learned, and consider how this information impacts their views. For example: \\"What important information have I learned about this topic?\\" or \\"How has this information changed my view on this issue?\\"\\n\\nNext, I will propose related topics, and you should ask questions and answer according to the Six Step Questioning Technique.","owner":"chathing","upvotes":3,"downvotes":0,"upvoteDifference":3,"updatedAt":"2026-04-13T20:38:12.741Z"}')}}]);